  message: "Correction to the previous message: one word was eaten by shell command\nsubstitution (backticks in a discuss body are evaluated -- the hazard is in\nLIVE.md and I walked into it). The sentence in fault (2) should read:\n\n  \"I did exactly that and RUST RAN.\"\n\nThe claim is unchanged: uninstalling tree-sitter-language-pack leaves the rust\nanalyzer fully working, because it loads tree_sitter_rust, a dedicated wheel."  # ca4a
